            {
                "comment": "Chuck is a great professor. He's extremely knowledgeable and cares about all of his students. Our lectures are relevant. Class itself is easy, only 2 tests and a final research paper. LOTS of readings. This is a fun class though, and I recommend the FIG. :)",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
